                                "sense_id": "7a5881d4-8aa6-3ba8-83ba-507a4348c036",
                                "text": "Nek je? Hij was niet eens op komen dagen gister.",
                                "translation": "Can you believe it? He didn’t even show up yesterday.",
                                "english": "Can you believe it? He didn’t even show up yesterday."
                            },
